697095216229464", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823812_697095222896130_4586145529412339006_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3tSqwIs8ZE0Q7kNvwE3jleN&_nc_oc=Adpleu9yGoT5wAPI6ISZ5nxYOYtd-fzL8-HLFnKXAPn5GaQWA2PUdY4Sp7UAZCM_v2Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ_-IB8BiS2LpVPvgZ1DF12VfdQIh5ztLQxqwmLiSH-Rg&oe=6AAE9000"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Zombash VR - Halloween Fun Game", "keywords": ["HalloweenGame", "HorrorGame", "ShootingGame", "ZombieGame", "FunGame"], "long_description": "Get ready for a frightfully fun experience in Zombash VR \u2013 Halloween Fun Game! Step into a haunted Halloween world filled with creepy sounds, glowing pumpkins, and endless waves of zombies coming for you. Armed with a variety of weapons, your mission is simple\u2014survive the night and bash every zombie in sight!\n\nEach environment offers a unique spooky challenge, from dark graveyards and foggy streets to haunted pumpkin fields. With immersive VR mechanics, smooth controls, and spine-tingling visuals, every moment feels alive with Halloween energy.\n\nWhether you\u2019re blasting zombies for fun, chasing high scores, or just soaking in the eerie Halloween atmosphere, Zombash VR delivers a perfect mix of action, excitement, and seasonal fun.\n\nGrab your gear, take your shot, and show those zombies who\u2019s boss this Halloween!", "short_description": "Step into the spooky world of Zombash VR \u2013 Halloween Fun Game! Fight off waves of zombies, explore eerie environments, and enjoy thrilling Halloween action in this fun and immersive VR adventure."}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-games-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "